# Film working files stay on disk only. Tracked: sources, small page images,
# and each film's final narrated MP4 when it is under 95 MB.

.env*

# Narration audio (per-sentence, paced and test takes)
**/audio/
**/sentences/

# Frame dumps, silent and alternate renders
**/out/frames-voice/
*-silent.mp4
snippets/experiments/out/akka-experiments-linkedin.mp4

# Rendered output of the films and decks whose renders are rebuilt locally
full/out/
mock/render/out/
proposal-panel/out/
sample/out/
talk/out/
talk-v2/out/

# Review stills, console captures and contact sheets
**/review/
tokenomics/captures/
**/contact/
proposal-panel/film/contact-sheet.png

# The every-idea films: render output and cut voice clips stay local. The narrated one-minute film, the
# four-minute film at web size and the caption files are tracked.
every-idea/film/out/*
!every-idea/film/out/every-idea-1min.mp4
!every-idea/film/out/every-idea-4min-web.mp4
!every-idea/film/out/*.srt
every-idea/film/voice*/cut/
every-idea/film/voice*/superseded/
every-idea/look-test/out/
